    "name": "Voice of Chernobyl",
    "steam_appid": 1886120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886120/extras/11686d883db9cbfee6c4a1ddebdbde5d.avif?t=1750369097\" /></div><strong>Voice of Chernobyl</strong> is a Multiplayer First-Person Shooter based in the eastern european &quot;world&quot;, with tons of weapons to play with that can be acquired freely and many maps that vary from each other like the size or theme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886120/extras/d6cb4b044233d67bba8a3ab96727e656.avif?t=1750369097\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you need more weapons? Then just play the game as you earn &quot;gold&quot; and &quot;bolts&quot; for free to acquire new weaponry to dominate and be the nemesis of your enemies, or armour to keep your head protected and consumables to patch up your wounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNIQUE GAMEMODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are currently 6 game modes in Voice of Chernobyl that are different from each other; Survival | Deathmatch | Team deathmatch | Melee fight | Arms Race | Zombie Infection. They each contain their own maps <i>(each game mode requires at least 2 players to play)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FREE CUSTOMIZABLE CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your self indistinguishable from others by just playing the game! You do not need to pay anything at all, earn free presents when a round ends, open them for free, earning you a random type of clothing with a random effect or colour. Make your own personal character to be unique from others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TAUNT YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to anger your enemies? Or to show off your moves? By pressing [G] you can dance, with others or alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO NEED FOR DLSS, RTX OR ANY OF THAT STUPID STUFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry! The game has been optimized to the point where you can run it on 13+ year old laptops. You don't need DLSS, RTX or any fake frame technology, the options include settings that modify the look of the game to run on any device that should be able to run Steam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AND MORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Such as the workshop level editor, the gibbing system on enemies and more. Download now and play for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886120/extras/863c11843289756035d47e56adc78a15.avif?t=1750369097\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Want to give feedback? Found any issues? Feel free to tell us! There is an active development channel in the server, and also other players in the server to talk to, or to play with</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886120/extras/11686d883db9cbfee6c4a1ddebdbde5d.avif?t=1750369097\" /></div><strong>Voice of Chernobyl</strong> is a Multiplayer First-Person Shooter based in the eastern european &quot;world&quot;, with tons of weapons to play with that can be acquired freely and many maps that vary from each other like the size or theme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886120/extras/d6cb4b044233d67bba8a3ab96727e656.avif?t=1750369097\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO MICROTRANSACTIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you need more weapons? Then just play the game as you earn &quot;gold&quot; and &quot;bolts&quot; for free to acquire new weaponry to dominate and be the nemesis of your enemies, or armour to keep your head protected and consumables to patch up your wounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNIQUE GAMEMODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are currently 6 game modes in Voice of Chernobyl that are different from each other; Survival | Deathmatch | Team deathmatch | Melee fight | Arms Race | Zombie Infection. They each contain their own maps <i>(each game mode requires at least 2 players to play)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FREE CUSTOMIZABLE CHARACTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your self indistinguishable from others by just playing the game! You do not need to pay anything at all, earn free presents when a round ends, open them for free, earning you a random type of clothing with a random effect or colour. Make your own personal character to be unique from others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TAUNT YOUR ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to anger your enemies? Or to show off your moves? By pressing [G] you can dance, with others or alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO NEED FOR DLSS, RTX OR ANY OF THAT STUPID STUFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry! The game has been optimized to the point where you can run it on 13+ year old laptops. You don't need DLSS, RTX or any fake frame technology, the options include settings that modify the look of the game to run on any device that should be able to run Steam</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AND MORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Such as the workshop level editor, the gibbing system on enemies and more. Download now and play for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1886120/extras/863c11843289756035d47e56adc78a15.avif?t=1750369097\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Want to give feedback? Found any issues? Feel free to tell us! There is an active development channel in the server, and also other players in the server to talk to, or to play with</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Voice of Chernobyl is a Multiplayer First-Person Shooter set in the eastern european world, with different variety of maps, weapons, items and more to create unique crazy battles!",
